WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.251
South Koreans are not

00:00:01.251 --> 00:00:03.253
having enough babies,

00:00:03.253 --> 00:00:05.255
which is a big problem for the military.

00:00:05.255 --> 00:00:06.631
Look at this wild chart.

00:00:06.631 --> 00:00:08.133
This is how many babies

00:00:08.133 --> 00:00:09.175
South Koreans are having.

00:00:09.175 --> 00:00:10.468
And you can see that

00:00:10.468 --> 00:00:12.053
it dips below this line,

00:00:12.053 --> 00:00:13.138
which means South Koreans

00:00:13.138 --> 00:00:15.765
are having less than one child per woman.

00:00:15.765 --> 00:00:16.683
This is a big crisis

00:00:16.683 --> 00:00:18.226
for the South Korean military,

00:00:18.226 --> 00:00:19.644
because South Koreans are required

00:00:19.644 --> 00:00:20.729
to serve in their military.

00:00:20.729 --> 00:00:21.813
But in the next 50 years,

00:00:21.813 --> 00:00:23.106
the number of people able to serve

00:00:23.106 --> 00:00:24.524
is going to be cut in half.

00:00:24.524 --> 00:00:26.192
Meanwhile, the nuclear-armed neighbor to

00:00:26.192 --> 00:00:26.776
the north

00:00:26.776 --> 00:00:28.319
has one of the largest armies

00:00:28.319 --> 00:00:29.404
in the world.

00:00:29.404 --> 00:00:30.155
So one group of South

00:00:30.155 --> 00:00:31.531
Koreans came up with a solution:

00:00:31.531 --> 00:00:32.907
The Senior Army.

00:00:32.907 --> 00:00:35.869
500 seniors like average age 63,

00:00:35.869 --> 00:00:37.746
have formed a volunteer group

00:00:37.746 --> 00:00:39.789
to train for military action.

00:00:39.789 --> 00:00:41.708
They’re not affiliated with the official army, but

00:00:41.708 --> 00:00:43.668
their goal is to be prepared to fight

00:00:43.668 --> 00:00:45.170
in case there is a conflict.

00:00:45.170 --> 00:00:47.172
So as South Korea's population dwindles

00:00:47.172 --> 00:00:48.548
because of this low birth rate,

00:00:48.548 --> 00:00:51.092
senior might be the solution to the army.

00:00:51.092 --> 00:00:51.885
If you want to better understand

00:00:51.885 --> 00:00:53.720
global politics, follow along for more.

